# Web

## Imports

- May import: `@preflight/schemas`, self.
- Never import: `@preflight/rules`, backend code, Prisma, GitAgent.
- Cross-package: `@preflight/*` names, never `../../packages/...`.
- Catalog via `GET /rules` only — never run matchers client-side.

## API

- Parse every response with `ApiResponse` schema from `@preflight/schemas`. No second envelope type in the app.
- Fetch logic in hooks (`useX.ts`), not in components.

## Structure

- Feature folders: `src/features/<screen>/` — component, hook, types co-located.
- Components: UI only. Logic in hooks.
- shadcn in `src/components/ui` only.

## Tokens (`documentation/08-design-system.md`)

- Hex only in CSS variables / Tailwind theme map. Components use token classes.
- No new `.css` files beyond `index.css` theme setup. No `style={{}}`.
- No density React context. Light mode only.
- Status chips, spans, ledger: semantic colours from 08 — not Primer blue, not chromatic brand on problems.

## Done

- `check-types` passes.
- Exercise the changed flow in the browser before claiming done — not a screenshot alone.
- Check shared state across routes that read the same data.
